kosha shiva-mooli

  "tirodhana-kriya anugraha-phala maya-siddha"
  "swatantra-sthita svairabhava-abheda abhaya-yukta"
  "rasayana-swarupa panchabhootam-kriya moksha-drishthanta"
  "manavata-siddha svayambhu-sthita mithya-satya-yukta"
  "domain-ayurveda-sthita vijaya-abheda"

  shabda tirodhana, anugraha, maya, swatantra, svairabhava, abhaya, rasayana, panchabhootam, moksha, manavata, svayambhu, mithya-satya, shiva-shakti, kama, vijaya, domain-ayurveda

done
